ule-features-description\">\n      <ul>\n                  <li> Efficient, versatile, lightweight &amp; portable</li>\n                  <li> Working platform design for aerial work</li>\n                  <li>Special 3-in-1fiber holde</li>\n                  <li>Warranty: 3 Year </li>\n              </ul>\n</div>\n\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"block-footer\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">View Details</a></div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n      </div>\n                    </div>\n</div>\n\n                  </div>\n                              </div>\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n                      </div>\n      </div>\n\n                                </div>\n                                                </div>","blocksHtml":"<div class=\"product-blocks blocks-default\">\n            <div class=\"product-blocks-default product-blocks-416 grid-rows\">\n          <div class=\"grid-row grid-row-416-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid-cols\">\n                      <div class=\"grid-col grid-col-416-1-1\">\n              <div class=\"grid-items\">\n                                  <div class=\"grid-item grid-item-416-1-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"module module-blocks module-blocks-417 blocks-tabs\">\n    <div class=\"module-body\">\n                <div class=\"tabs-container\">\n      <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n                  <li class=\"tab-2 active\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Description</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-4\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Product Table</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <h2><b>Jilong 500E Mini FTTx Fiber Fusion Splicer – Best Price in Bangladesh (2025)</b></h2><p>Compact, High-Performance Splicing for FTTx Networks</p><p>The Jilong 500E Mini FTTx Fiber Fusion Splicer is a lightweight, efficient, and portable fiber splicing machine, designed specifically for FTTx, FTTH, and backbone fiber optic networks. Equipped with active clad-alignment technology, it delivers fast, precise splicing with minimal loss, making it the perfect tool for field technicians and fiber engineers.</p><h3><b>Key Features&nbsp;</b></h3><ul><li>Active Clad-Alignment Technology – Ensures accurate fiber alignment for low splice loss</li><li>Ultra-Fast Splicing &amp; Heating – 6 sec. quick splicing &amp; 18 sec. fast heating for maximum efficiency</li><li>Lightweight &amp; Portable Design – Weighs only 1.35kg (with battery) – Ideal for fieldwork &amp; aerial splicing</li><li>3.5-inch High-Resolution Color Display – 800x480 pixel screen for clear fiber viewing</li><li>User-Friendly Operation – Easy-to-use interface with automatic arc &amp; fiber identification</li><li>Powerful 4000mAh Battery – Supports 120+ splicing &amp; heating cycles per charge</li><li>Rugged &amp; Durable – Designed for harsh environments with dust-proof, water-resistant construction</li><li>Large Data Storage – Saves 10,000 splice records &amp; 2,000 images for future reference</li><li>Wide Fiber Compatibility – Supports SM, MM, DS, NZDS, and G.657 fiber types</li></ul><p><br></p><h3><b>Jilong 500E Mini Fusion Splicer Technical Specifications</b></h3><ul><li>Alignment Method: Active Clad-Alignment</li><li>Applicable Fiber Types: SM (G.652/G.657), MM (G.651), DS (G.653), NZDS (G.655)</li><li>Compatible Fiber/Cable: 0.25~3.0mm, Leather Cable</li><li>Fiber Cleave Length: 8-16mm</li><li>Splicing Time: 6 sec. (SM G652 Quick Mode)</li><li>Heating Time: 18 sec. (Adjustable)</li><li>Splice Loss: SM: 0.02dB, MM: 0.01dB, DS: 0.04dB, NZDS: 0.04dB</li><li>Return Loss: &gt;60dB</li><li>Electrode Life: 5,000 arcs (replaceable)</li><li>Battery: 4000mAh, supports 120+ splicing &amp; heating cycles per charge</li><li>Storage Capacity: 10,000 splice records, 2,000 images</li><li>Tension Test: Altitude: 0~5,000m, -20°C to +50°C, Max Wind Speed: 15m/s</li><li>Weight: 1.06kg (without battery), 1.35kg (with battery)</li><li>Display: 3.5-inch high-resolution (800x480) color touchscreen</li><li>USB 2.0 Port – For firmware updates &amp; data transfer</li></ul><p><br></p><h4><b>Why Choose the Jilong 500E Mini Fusion Splicer?</b></h4><p>Perfect for FTTx, FTTH, and Fiber Backbone Networks</p><p>Fast Splicing &amp; Heating – Saves Time &amp; Increases Efficiency</p><p>Lightweight &amp; Compact – Ideal for Aerial &amp; Field Operations</p><p>Durable &amp; Rugged – Built for Tough Environments</p><p>Best Price in Bangladesh (2025) – Unbeatable Value</p>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibi